# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo: what the sound and the vibration do on the Redmi K20 Pro.
# The audio server reads the ringer's state when it starts; if SpringBoard has not set it by then it stays silent.
# "springboard" waits for the state to be "on" and announces it again, which the audio server hears.
/redwood/bin/sound_test springboard
/redwood/bin/sound_test wait 3 route
/redwood/bin/sound_test system 1100
/redwood/bin/sound_test wait 2 haptic
